ur shields,\" you murmur." }, { "regex", "^\"I deem you unfit for Creation!\" you proclaim, pointing imperiously at (\\w+).$" }, { "regex", "^\"And thus I deem you unfit for Creation!\" you proclaim, pointing imperiously at (\\w+).$" }, { "regex", "^\"May you yet feel the pain you so inflict.\" you recite to (\\w+), your holy protections surging around you.$" }, { "regex", "^\"And see that which Evil reaps!\" you recite to (\\w+).$" }, { "exact", "\"A bulwark to stave off the darkness!\" you thunder, spreading your arms wide in supplication." }, { "regex", "^\"The light shall not be denied,\" you declare, as you prepare for your clash with (\\w+).$" }, { "regex", "^\"For justice shall not be averted,\" you declare, as you prepare for your clash with (\\w+).$" }, { "regex", "^\"Protected from the ravages of the Outer Cold,\" you murmur, laying a hand upon the brow of (\\w+).$" }, { "exact", "\"Protected from the ravages of the Outer Cold,\" you murmur." }, { "regex", "^\"We shall not falter,\" you murmur, laying a hand upon the brow of (\\w+).$" }, { "regex", "^\"For we shall not falter,\" you murmur, laying a hand upon the brow of (\\w+).$" }, { "exact", "\"We shall not falter,\" you murmur." }, { "exact", "\"For we shall not falter,\" you murmur." }, { "regex", "^\"Burn, blight upon Creation!\" you dictate to (\\w+), holy flame wreathing \\w+ in cleansing fury.$" }, { "regex", "^\"And may the cleansing fires consume you!\" you dictate to (w\\+), holy flame wreathing \\w+ incleansing fury.$" } },
