t to your chest." }, { "exact", "The ground beneath you begins to shake and it sends all around it tumbling to the ground." } },
    { "Stun (2s)", { "exact", "Hefting an impressive block of debris, a young worshipper brings it crashing down on your head." } },
    { "Stupidity", { "exact", "Raising her hands to the sky, an Eleusian elementalist summons a mighty hailstorm upon you. The falling stones strike your head, leaving your mind scrambled." }, { "exact", "Swinging his off-hand, an Ashtani corsair catches you on the temple with a tactless blow that leaves you struggling to think clearly." }, { "exact", "Moving with precision, a runic knight quickly swings his broadsword at your head. Turning at the last instant, he brings the flat of his blade in contact with your skull, knocking you senseless." }, { "exact", "An infernal wraith pulls back harshly on the reins of his steed, which rears back and kicks you powerfully in the forehead. Your mind swims as you reel from the blow." }, { "exact", "As the liquid enters your system, you begin to feel your intelligence slowly drop." }, { "exact", "His muscles heaving, a dwarf smith bashes you in the head with his hammer." }, { "exact", "A humble monk step towards you, striking you directly under your chin with his staff. The blow causes your vision to swim and things become hazy." }, { "exact", "Lord Adryn balls his fat hand into a fist and pounds it against the side of your head." }, { "exact", "You fall back on your heels, feeling disoriented and strange." }, { "exact", "A diligent monk step towards you, striking you directly under your chin with her staff. The blow causes your vision to swim and things become hazy." }, { "exact", "Stepping smartly forward, a court constable twirls his baton before swinging it at your head. The sturdy wood connects solidly, and you reel dizzily from the blow." }, { "exact", "A mad cackle echoes throughout the cavern as you are pounded repeatedly with a blunt object from an unseen assailant." }, { "exact", "A stern monk step towards you, striking you directly under your chin with his staff. The blow causes your vision to swim and things become hazy." }, { "exact", "Tossing his club aside, a massive wendigo grabs you with a vice-like grip and easily lifts you up, then brutally slams you into the ground." }, { "exact", "The staff in Jerak, Captain of the Guard's hands becomes a blur as he slams it into your head three times in rapid succession, then finishes with a vicious thrust to your chest." } },
    { "Slashed throat", { "exact", "Xerafel lumbers toward you with surprising speed, and slits your throat viciously with a long, thin blade." } },
    { "Shyness", { "exact", "Vingar, the Mercenary Captain yells a roaring battle cry and advances towards you, an evil grin on his face. Panicked, you dive for cover." } },
    { "Transfix", { "exact", "Xulu, an orc witchdoctor bows his head and closes his eyes. After a moment, you feel your mind becoming entangled and twisted by his mental puissance." }, { "exact", "Waving his appendages before your face, a tentacled polyp leaves a number of deep lacerations and manages to leave you transfixed." }, { "exact", "A cloud of gnats flies about in stunning patterns, transfixing your attention." }, { "exact", "A proud ducal guard whirls his blades in a shining nexus of glittering steel that seizes your attention and transfixes you utterly." }, { "exact", "Encircling you with his large body, a large, albino centipede rapidly spins around you in a mesmerising display." } },
    { "Voyria", { "exact", "A giant sea serpent's teeth puncture through skin as he clamps down tightly, sending his venom coursing into you." }, { "exact", "You watch in horror as a hooded man clamps his ebon teeth into your skin. You begin to sweat profusely as a sickly venom ebbs into your blood." }, { "exact", "A Rhaan of Enuru draws a pair of blackened longswords, each dripping with a translucent liquid, and plunges them deep into your body." } },
    { "Webbed", { "exact", "Stretching her fingers outward, Erato, spirit of the Eastern Ithmia coaxes a tangle of vines and branches from the surrounding forest to hinder you." }, { "exact", "An elite guardsman touches a web tattoo, and you are covered with sticky webs." }, { "exact", "Issuing a garbled chant, a dwarf initiate points her warhammer at you and covers you with a sticky black film." }, { "exact", "A large pulsating spider sprays you with a sticky webbing, which quickly entangles your limbs." }, { "exact", "Long, translucent tentacles encircle your limbs as a monstrous skolef crushes the life from you." }, { "exact", "Shadows suddenly coalesce and pull at you at Gloom, the Occultist's invocation." }, { "exact", "Lashing out at your arms, Kimitia, a Quisalis apprentice wraps her whip around your wrists and pulls you hard to the ground." }, { "exact", "Inish, the head cultist chants solemnly, weaving his hands and sending an entangling web of crimson magic over you." }, { "exact", "A mass of sticky tendrils streak out from an enormous marsh ooze, wrapping you in a cocoon of slime." }, { "exact", "Malvoc, the unholy reaches into the dark ether and pulls out a powerful soulspear, which he quickly sends flying into your torso." }, { "exact", "An ugly tentacle lashes out from a hideous claw fiend and wraps around your torso, pulling you closer to its hideous form." }, { "exact", "A battered Ashtani lieutenant makes a lunging stab at you with his longsword, impaling you to the hilt." }, { "exact", "Frogtima the Prophetess spits at you with a corrosive glob of green goo." }, { "exact", "Tightly grasping a lengthy cloth, Tickler, the tavernkeeper flicks it at you, whipping your chest and entangling you in the rag." }, { "exact", "The Termite Queen opens her maw, unleashing a netting of saliva across the chamber." }, { "exact", "Aiming her bow downwards, an apprentice assassin fires an arrow into your foot, pinning you to the ground." }, { "exact", "Lashing out at your arms, Kimitia, a Quisalis Assassin wraps her whip around your wrists and pulls you hard to the ground." }, { "exact", "An unkempt horse thief flings his whip in your direction and traps you in a painful mass of rope." } },
    { "Sleep", { "exact", "Abruptly, you feel a stabbing pain in your chest before you feel yourself drift into sleep as a disembodied voice whispers, \"Sleep, sleep...\"" }, { "exact", "A sense of exhaustion suddenly overcomes you, causing you to take a nap." } },
  },
